cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use MantiShrimp, please cite this software using the metadata below."
title: "MantiShrimp: agent-based modelling of killer immune cell-target cell interactions with Bayesian inference"
type: software
version: 0.1.0
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/sthsci/MantiShrimp"
url: "https://github.com/sthsci/MantiShrimp"
abstract: >-
  MantiShrimp is a Python package for off-lattice agent-based modelling of
  killer immune cell-target cell interactions using Hookean mechanics and for
  Bayesian population-level inference from contacts or kills per killer cell.
keywords:
  - agent-based modelling
  - natural killer cells
  - tumour immunology
  - Bayesian inference
  - stochastic processes
